  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, the cartomancer has learned to get past the bias of self and give herself a fair reading. She may now tell her own fortune using the tell fortune class feature. When telling her own fortune, the complex fortune, heightened fortune, and manipulate fortune class features do not expend additional uses of the tell fortune class feature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancer#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
